THE REGISTRY's fragments (docs/PORT-GOOSE.md, THE RUNTIME LAYOUT, "The registry").

One file per construct card: <construct>.goosereg. The schema compiler
assembles every fragment's declarations and entries onto the end of
schema_tables.goose when the Goose target emits it, so no card edits a shared
enum or array. The format and its refusals are in ../../registry.go.

This README is not a fragment; it keeps the directory embeddable while no
fragment exists.
